<body>
    <h1>Agent Assist</h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <div class=3D"contentLayout2">
<div class=3D"columnLayout fixed-width" data-layout=3D"fixed-width">
<div class=3D"cell normal" data-type=3D"normal">
<div class=3D"innerCell">
<p>The =E2=80=9CLogic + Agent Assist=E2=80=9D panel is a mechanism that fac=
ilitates displaying data within the interaction user interface in the Sharp=
en Q. It enables agents to access caller information through seamless integ=
ration with other system components, such as the Integration panel. Typical=
ly, this is achieved via API calls performing Automatic Number Identificati=
on (ANI) lookups, which retrieves and presents comprehensive caller details=
 directly to the agent's workspace.</p><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-f=
ile-wrapper image-center-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size"><img clas=
s=3D"confluence-embedded-image image-center" alt=3D"agentAssistPanel.png" w=
idth=3D"268" loading=3D"lazy" src=3D"e949b3a23cfffd40d6b174653e6c5075706900=
79d2907f7f48e6a858d3479c19" data-image-src=3D"https://sharpencx.atlassian.n=
et/wiki/download/attachments/4467294230/agentAssistPanel.png?version=3D1&am=
p;modificationDate=3D1738779256490&amp;cacheVersion=3D1&amp;api=3Dv2" data-=
height=3D"80" data-width=3D"268" data-unresolved-comment-count=3D"0" data-l=
inked-resource-id=3D"4467294250" data-linked-resource-version=3D"1" data-li=
nked-resource-type=3D"attachment" data-linked-resource-default-alias=3D"age=
ntAssistPanel.png" data-base-url=3D"https://sharpencx.atlassian.net/wiki" d=
ata-linked-resource-content-type=3D"image/png" data-linked-resource-contain=
er-id=3D"4467294230" data-linked-resource-container-version=3D"3" data-medi=
a-id=3D"808b5bf7-fbfb-4e86-b02e-7d523113eaa1" data-media-type=3D"file" heig=
ht=3D"79"></span>
<h2 id=3D"AgentAssist-Usingthispanel">Using this panel</h2>
<p>The Agent Assist panel is a valuable tool designed to enhance agent prod=
uctivity by providing critical interaction details in real time. This featu=
re streamlines workflows and improves efficiency, enabling agents to handle=
 tasks more effectively.</p>
<p><strong>Key capabilities include:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Displaying essential interaction details within the Sharpen Q UI</p></li=
>
<li>
<p>Optimizing agent performance by delivering relevant insights</p></li>
</ul>
<h2 id=3D"AgentAssist-Configuration">Configuration</h2>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class=3D"columnLayout two-equal" data-layout=3D"two-equal">
<div class=3D"cell normal" data-type=3D"normal">
<div class=3D"innerCell">
<p>The Subroutine panel has the following settings as shown in <strong>Figu=
re 2</strong>:</p>
<ol start=3D"1">
<li>
<p><strong>Set as Flow Initiator</strong>: Selecting <strong>"Set as Flow I=
nitiator"</strong> designates this panel as the starting point of the IVR f=
low. Once initiated, the system will proceed to subsequent panels within th=
e Logic+ flow.</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Panel Name</strong>: Choose a clear and consistent name for the =
panel. Additionally, specify the variable name to update=E2=80=94if the var=
iable does not already exist, it will be created automatically</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Panel Description</strong>: Provide a concise yet informative de=
scription of the panel, outlining its purpose and functionality. This serve=
s as essential documentation, helping others understand its intended use at=
 a glance.</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Content</strong>: The text box allows you to pass important info=
rmation to agents within the Sharpen Q UI. This can include formatted varia=
bles using <code>$()</code> to dynamically display data from previous panel=
s, or even URLs for agent interaction.</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Exit Paths:</strong> Use the dropdown menu to link this panel to=
 another within your flow. Any output from this panel will automatically tr=
ansition to the selected panel.</p></li>
</ol>
</div>
</div>
<div class=3D"cell normal" data-type=3D"normal">
<div class=3D"innerCell">
<p></p><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper=
 confluence-embedded-manual-size"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image i=
mage-center" width=3D"350" loading=3D"lazy" src=3D"44593409c12444fd9a3130c4=
f804cccc86348d57f47c84f1894925e636ec76c5" data-image-src=3D"https://sharpen=
cx.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/4467294230/Screenshot%202025-02-=
05%20at%209.24.36%E2%80%AFAM.png?version=3D1&amp;modificationDate=3D1738779=
256243&amp;cacheVersion=3D1&amp;api=3Dv2" data-height=3D"360" data-width=3D=
"196" data-unresolved-comment-count=3D"0" data-linked-resource-id=3D"446729=
4247" data-linked-resource-version=3D"1" data-linked-resource-type=3D"attac=
hment" data-linked-resource-default-alias=3D"Screenshot 2025-02-05 at 9.24.=
36=E2=80=AFAM.png" data-base-url=3D"https://sharpencx.atlassian.net/wiki" d=
ata-linked-resource-content-type=3D"image/png" data-linked-resource-contain=
er-id=3D"4467294230" data-linked-resource-container-version=3D"3" data-medi=
a-id=3D"98d20da5-281e-46a9-90aa-d6aff968e622" data-media-type=3D"file" heig=
ht=3D"643"></span>
<p></p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class=3D"columnLayout fixed-width" data-layout=3D"fixed-width">
<div class=3D"cell normal" data-type=3D"normal">
<div class=3D"innerCell">
<h3 id=3D"AgentAssist-SharpenUIExample"><strong>Sharpen UI Example</strong>=
</h3>
<p>In the example below, an integration panel performs an ANI lookup to ret=
rieve caller information. Specifically, it acquires the <strong>Member ID</=
strong> and stores it in a variable named <code>$(memberID)</code>. This va=
riable is then placed in the <strong>Content</strong> text box in the <stro=
ng>Agent Assist</strong> panel, allowing the data to be displayed to the ag=
ent within the Sharpen Q UI.</p><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wra=
pper image-center-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size"><img class=3D"co=
nfluence-embedded-image image-center" alt=3D"agentAssistUI.png" width=3D"46=
8" loading=3D"lazy" src=3D"ba27aa68c81d71f1ba4a53bf6e86edab4e07a5053e5cede1=
1064fb216cf6965a" data-image-src=3D"https://sharpencx.atlassian.net/wiki/do=
wnload/attachments/4467294230/agentAssistUI.png?version=3D2&amp;modificatio=
nDate=3D1738779496783&amp;cacheVersion=3D1&amp;api=3Dv2" data-height=3D"246=
" data-width=3D"768" data-unresolved-comment-count=3D"0" data-linked-resour=
ce-id=3D"4467294244" data-linked-resource-version=3D"2" data-linked-resourc=
e-type=3D"attachment" data-linked-resource-default-alias=3D"agentAssistUI.p=
ng" data-base-url=3D"https://sharpencx.atlassian.net/wiki" data-linked-reso=
urce-content-type=3D"image/png" data-linked-resource-container-id=3D"446729=
4230" data-linked-resource-container-version=3D"3" data-media-id=3D"b844e05=
4-633b-4cf3-9677-6f1f75008dfb" data-media-type=3D"file" height=3D"150"></sp=
an>
<p>As part of a call flow, other variables may be available according to ou=
r <a href=3D"https://sharpencx.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/CT1/pages/42313646=
09/Available+Predefined+Variables" data-linked-resource-id=3D"4231364609" d=
ata-linked-resource-version=3D"18" data-linked-resource-type=3D"page">Avail=
able Predefined Variables</a> KB.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
